   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>The students in class 8/C answered the question “<b>What type of holiday do you prefer?</b>”</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 290\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Tatil türü tercih grafiği\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><text x=\"280\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Favourite Holiday Types – Class 8/C</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"32\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Boys</text><rect x=\"290\" y=\"32\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" fill=\"#f472b6\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Girls</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"250.0\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"250.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"254.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"211.6\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"211.6\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"215.6\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"173.2\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"173.2\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"177.2\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"134.8\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"134.8\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"138.8\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"96.4\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"96.4\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"100.4\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">8</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"58.0\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"58.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"44\" y=\"62.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><rect x=\"68.6\" y=\"134.8\" width=\"43.3\" height=\"115.2\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"111.9\" y=\"77.2\" width=\"43.3\" height=\"172.8\" fill=\"#f472b6\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"111.9\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Seaside</text><rect x=\"192.3\" y=\"192.4\" width=\"43.3\" height=\"57.6\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"235.6\" y=\"134.8\" width=\"43.3\" height=\"115.2\" fill=\"#f472b6\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"235.6\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Cultural</text><rect x=\"316.1\" y=\"96.4\" width=\"43.3\" height=\"153.6\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"359.4\" y=\"173.2\" width=\"43.3\" height=\"76.8\" fill=\"#f472b6\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"359.4\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Nature</text><rect x=\"439.8\" y=\"115.6\" width=\"43.3\" height=\"134.4\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><rect x=\"483.1\" y=\"211.6\" width=\"43.3\" height=\"38.4\" fill=\"#f472b6\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"/><text x=\"483.1\" y=\"268\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Winter</text><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"545\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"50\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></div><p>According to the chart, which of the following is <b>NOT</b> correct?</p>",
