   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Three friends are talking about their next holiday. Look at the destinations and the speech bubbles.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 320\" width=\"560\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Gezi yerleri ve konuşma balonları\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><rect x=\"6\" y=\"6\" width=\"140\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Uzungöl</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">lake, green forests</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">hiking, fresh air</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">cool summers</text><rect x=\"154\" y=\"6\" width=\"140\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e0f2fe\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"224\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bodrum</text><text x=\"224\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">sandy beaches</text><text x=\"224\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">swimming, sailing</text><text x=\"224\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">hot and busy</text><rect x=\"302\" y=\"6\" width=\"140\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fef3c7\" stroke=\"#b45309\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"372\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ephesus</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ancient ruins</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Roman theatre</text><text x=\"372\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">guided tours</text><rect x=\"450\" y=\"6\" width=\"140\" height=\"92\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"520\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Palandöken</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">snowy mountains</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">skiing</text><text x=\"520\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"11.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dec – March</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"132\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">S</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"165\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Selin</text><rect x=\"64\" y=\"112\" width=\"528\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"133\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">I can’t stand hot weather and crowded beaches. I just want to breathe</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">fresh air and walk among the trees.</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"200\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"206\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">O</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"233\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ozan</text><rect x=\"64\" y=\"180\" width=\"528\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"201\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">I’m keen on history. I want to see where people lived and watched</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">plays thousands of years ago.</text><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"268\" r=\"18\" fill=\"#10b981\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">E</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"301\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Ece</text><rect x=\"64\" y=\"248\" width=\"528\" height=\"50\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\"/><text x=\"76\" y=\"269\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Swimming isn’t my cup of tea. I’d rather slide down white slopes in</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"12.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">February.</text></svg></div><p>Which of the following matches each person with the most suitable place?</p>",
