   "lv": "orta",
   "q": "<p>The chart shows the answers of 100 teenagers and 100 adults.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 290\" width=\"540\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Konaklama tercihi çift sütun grafiği\" font-family=\"Arial, sans-serif\"><text x=\"270\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Where would you rather stay on holiday?</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"middle\">(100 teenagers and 100 adults)</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"240.0\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"240.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"244.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"204.0\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"204.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"208.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">10</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"168.0\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"168.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"172.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">20</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"132.0\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"132.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"136.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">30</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"96.0\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"96.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"100.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">40</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"60.0\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"60.0\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"64.0\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#475569\" text-anchor=\"end\">50</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"520\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#334155\"/><rect x=\"85\" y=\"168.0\" width=\"34\" height=\"72.0\" fill=\"#f97316\"/><text x=\"102\" y=\"163.0\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">20</text><rect x=\"123\" y=\"78.0\" width=\"34\" height=\"162.0\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/><text x=\"140\" y=\"73.0\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">45</text><text x=\"121\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hotel</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"150.0\" width=\"34\" height=\"90.0\" fill=\"#f97316\"/><text x=\"217\" y=\"145.0\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25</text><rect x=\"238\" y=\"222.0\" width=\"34\" height=\"18.0\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/><text x=\"255\" y=\"217.0\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"236\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Hostel</text><rect x=\"315\" y=\"96.0\" width=\"34\" height=\"144.0\" fill=\"#f97316\"/><text x=\"332\" y=\"91.0\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">40</text><rect x=\"353\" y=\"186.0\" width=\"34\" height=\"54.0\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"181.0\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text><text x=\"351\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Campsite</text><rect x=\"430\" y=\"186.0\" width=\"34\" height=\"54.0\" fill=\"#f97316\"/><text x=\"447\" y=\"181.0\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">15</text><rect x=\"468\" y=\"114.0\" width=\"34\" height=\"126.0\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/><text x=\"485\" y=\"109.0\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">35</text><text x=\"466\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Guesthouse</text><rect x=\"160\" y=\"268\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#f97316\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"279\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Teenagers</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"268\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#0f766e\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"279\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\">Adults</text></svg></div><p>According to the chart, which of the following is <b>CORRECT</b>?</p>",
